  "slug": "an-e-mail",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/13530_an-e-mail.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Yesterday I received an email from Danny. Danny was my boyfriend in college. After graduating from college, I worked in China and he went to Canada to continue his studies. After the breakup, we didn't see each other for five years. He told me in the email that he will return to China from Canada next month and hopes to meet and chat with me after arriving in Beijing. I didn't sleep all night. I was a little excited, a little worried, a little looking forward to it, a little scared, and my mood was very complicated. I wonder what he has become now? Does he still like spicy food? Have you gained weight? Married? Have you graduated with a PhD? Are you happy with your life? Although the breakup was heartbreaking, we had a very happy few years together, so I wanted him to be happy too. I really want to go to next month soon!"
  ],
  "english_full": "Yesterday I received an email from Danny. Danny was my boyfriend in college. After graduating from college, I worked in China and he went to Canada to continue his studies. After the breakup, we didn't see each other for five years. He told me in the email that he will return to China from Canada next month and hopes to meet and chat with me after arriving in Beijing. I didn't sleep all night. I was a little excited, a little worried, a little looking forward to it, a little scared, and my mood was very complicated. I wonder what he has become now? Does he still like spicy food? Have you gained weight? Married? Have you graduated with a PhD? Are you happy with your life? Although the breakup was heartbreaking, we had a very happy few years together, so I wanted him to be happy too. I really want to go to next month soon!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Вчера́ я получи́ла име́йл от Дэ́нни. Дэ́нни был моим бойфре́ндом в ко́лледже. По́сле выпу́ска из ко́лледжа я рабо́тала в Кита́е, а он уехал в Кана́ду, чтобы продолжа́ть свои́ уче́ния. По́сле разры́ва мы не ви́дели друг дру́га целых пять лет. Он со́общил мне в име́йле, что он верну́тся в Кита́й из Кана́ды в сле́дующем ме́сяце и наде́ется встретиться и поболе́ть со мной по́сле прибы́тия в Пеки́н. Я не спа́ла всю но́чь. Я была́ немно́го взволнованна, немно́го беспоко́йная, немно́го жда́ла этого, немно́го напу́ганная, и моё настрое́ние было́ за́путанным. Мне интере́сно, кем он ста́л сейча́с? До́рого ли он ещё любит о́струю пи́щу? Ты не при́бавила вес? Жена́та? Ты выпу́скники с кандидата́том нау́к? Ты счастли́ва в своей жи́зни? Хотя́ разрыв был душераздира́ющим, у нас были́ о́чень счастли́вые не́сколько лет вме́сте, поэ́тому я тоже хотела́, чтобы он был счастли́в. Я де́йствительно хочу́ пойти в сле́дующем ме́сяце ско́ро!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Včера́ ja polučila iméjl ot Dếnni. Dếnni byl moim bójfrendom v kólledže. Pósle vypuśka iz kólledža ja rábotala v Kitáe, a on ujéxal v Kanádu, čtoby prōdolját' svoí učéniya. Pósle razrýva my ne vídeli drúg drúga celý píat' let. On sóobšil mne v iméjle, čtoby on vernút'sya v Kitáj iz Kanády v slédujuščem mésiace i nadéetsya vstrétit'sya i pobolét' so mnôi pósle pribýtiya v Pekín. Ja ne spála vsyú nóč'. Ja bylá nemnógo vzvolnovánna, nemnógo bespokójnaya, nemnógo ždala etogo, nemnógo napúgan'naya, i moë nastróenie byló zapútannym. Mne interesno, kém on stál seýčaś? Dórogo li on éšče ljúbit' óstruju píšču? Ty ne príbavila ves? Ženáta? Ty vypuśknik s kandidat́atom naúk? Ty schastlíva v svojey žizni? Khotjá razрыв byl dušerazdyrájuščim, u nas býli óčén' schastlívye ně́skol'ko let vméste, poétymu ja tóže khótela, čtóby on byl schastlív. Ja déjstvítel'no khóchu pojti v slédujuščem mésiace skórо!"
  ],
